{"title":"Leather Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bear, Copperhead, Small Copperhead, Antlion Pitling, Hill Giant Youth +3 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dire-wolf\" title=\"Dire Wolf - dropped it in 1 of 8 looted corpses (1/8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d535eb40d6ac5fcfceaa.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dire Wolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"giant-spider\" title=\"Mother Sallow - dropped it in 1 of 16 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/18a260cc427b201aa0b5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mother Sallow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-youth\" title=\"Hill Giant Youth - dropped it in 1 of 25 looted corpses (1/25)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/969fc0f03105396b9256.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/25<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"orc\" title=\"Orc - dropped it in 1 of 26 looted corpses (1/26)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4178e6f94d79da2c1ae.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Orc</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/26<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+4 more\">+4 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bear\" title=\"Bear - dropped it in 1 of 44 looted corpses (1/44)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6ea4940d5e77a776b717.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/44<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"antlion-pitling\" title=\"Antlion Pitling - dropped it in 1 of 63 looted corpses (1/63)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/922f1f2a8e0dca1a9c52.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antlion Pitling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/63<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"copperhead-small\" title=\"Small Copperhead - dropped it in 1 of 106 looted corpses (1/106)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/be8b9bef374f5b2e593b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Small Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/106<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"copperhead-medium\" title=\"Copperhead - dropped it in 1 of 224 looted corpses (1/224)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b134e63b0f937131e7db.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Copperhead</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/224<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"leather-head\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip on q-all\" href=\"#/item/leather-head\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/leather-head?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/leather-head?q=crude\">Crude <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/leather-head?q=shoddy\">Shoddy <span